        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Runs Versal Net protection checks after cache reload. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Protection status bits live in TBITS0_SVD. Each active protection bit requires its protected fuse region to be programmed.</para><para><simplesect kind="return"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>XST_SUCCESS when all active protection rules pass.</para></listitem><listitem><para>XNVM_EFUSE_ERR_ANCHOR_BIT_PATTERN on bad anchor pattern.</para></listitem><listitem><para>XNVM_EFUSE_ERR_IN_PROTECTION_CHECK on protected-data mismatch.</para></listitem><listitem><para>XNVM_EFUSE_XLNX_MANFAC_BITS_CRC_ERROR on CRC failure. </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
